WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
Nusumareta kako wo

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
Sagashitsuzukete

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Ore wa samayou

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
Mishiranu machi wo

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Honou no nioi shimitsuite

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Museru

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Sayonara wa itta hazu da

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
Wakareta hazu sa

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
Jigoku wo mireba

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
Kokoro ga kawaku

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Tatakai wa akita no sa

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
Sadame to areba

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Kokoro wo kimeru

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
Sottoshite oite kure

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Ashita ni

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Aa tsunagaru kyou gurai

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:34.460
Target is the Munamera River castle.
West, 20 klicks.

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:36.330
The five soldiers who found him are standing by.

00:01:36.330 --> 00:01:38.880
Roger. Approaching target area.

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:50.210
Target area entered.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.500
Will take him aboard at once.

00:01:58.170 --> 00:02:03.210
Turnabout

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:09.420
Chirico?!

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:12.380
Oh, it's you, Pops.

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:18.710
I can barely think. Do you know what time it is?

00:02:18.710 --> 00:02:20.710
What? What did you say?

00:02:20.710 --> 00:02:22.540
What's all the racket?!

00:02:22.540 --> 00:02:25.080
What's up at this hour?

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:28.000
It's Chirico... Chirico's come back!

00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:30.380
What?! Seriously?

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:32.710
I knew it. I just knew it!

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:34.710
You just can't kill that guy!

00:02:34.710 --> 00:02:36.880
He's all right, isn't he?

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:38.040
Really?!

00:02:39.710 --> 00:02:41.920
Can I assume Chirico's in one piece?

00:02:42.210 --> 00:02:44.380
Great! Great news! Fantastic!

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:45.960
Chirico!

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:46.710
Whoa. Whoa.

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:50.250
Let's take a day off. We can go visit him!

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:51.130
Come on!

00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:52.460
You're going dressed like that?

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:57.580
Guess I got a little carried away.

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:05.830
Good for you, Chirico!

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:07.330
Okay!

00:03:24.460 --> 00:03:26.130
I want you all out!

00:03:26.130 --> 00:03:27.460
We're going to interrogate him!

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:29.080
You're what?!

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:31.130
I can't allow that.

00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:33.130
He's suffering from extreme exhaustion.

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:34.790
Exhaustion?

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:37.380
A man who, by himself, without even an AT,

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:40.500
escaped from the Veela
shouldn't have any trouble.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:43.960
Considering how he came back
with all body parts intact.

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:45.880
Just what are you implying?

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:51.750
Sir, I think this man joined up with the Veela.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:54.250
And he cut a deal with them.

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:56.880
That's how he made it back in one piece.

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:58.750
We have to interrogate him!

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:10.830
If you order it, you may. But it could kill him!

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:15.710
And if he starts to slip,
you'll just let him die, right?!

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:17.170
Sh-shut up!

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:20.380
Gonna kill him after he made it back alive?!

00:04:20.380 --> 00:04:21.540
You son of a...!

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:23.830
You're a damned murderer!

00:04:27.130 --> 00:04:29.920
Truth hurts, don't it?!

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:33.540
Hold it.

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:37.170
We'll let Chirico recover.

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:38.630
Doctor, take care of him.

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:41.500
Thank you, Mr. Big Shot.

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:46.630
Get him better as fast as you can! Got that?!

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:58.540
I'm not doing that again for you.

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:00.580
Don't worry, your debt's paid.

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:02.380
Here, take this.

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:07.080
You just saved a man.

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:09.710
Chirico never would have survived those two.

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:12.210
Let's see... No fever.

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:16.460
Of course not. Just get some rest, okay?

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:22.210
Anyway, I can't believe you made it back.

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:24.500
Kan Yu has a right to be suspicious.

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:27.210
Did you really meet up with the Veela?

00:05:28.130 --> 00:05:29.040
Yeah.

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:30.170
What?!

00:05:30.170 --> 00:05:32.000
I even met Kanjelman.

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:37.080
What's his effective strength?

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:38.710
Far stronger than imagined.

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:43.960
If he tries anything big now,
this war's gonna drag on.

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:47.130
I suppose you saw the Phantom Lady, too.

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:51.920
Yeah. She helped me escape.

00:05:52.170 --> 00:05:53.500
Oh...

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:55.080
So, that's how you did it.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:58.040
You've got the devil's own luck, you know that?

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:21.000
Surely you don't think I let Chirico go, Highness.

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:24.000
I said I didn't believe that.

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:27.130
But Chirico couldn't have escaped on his own.

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:33.210
Then who do you suspect?

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:35.080
Calm yourself.

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:39.080
Even if you were the culprit,
I'd understand your feelings perfectly.

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:40.710
Your Highness!

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:46.580
Your pride as a Perfect Soldier demands
that you best Chirico on the battlefield.

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:47.670
Am I wrong?

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:08.210
Ypsilon, showing your pride is admirable.

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:12.170
But remember this: It is also your weakness!

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:15.130
Training is over.

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:23.580
Don't miss your daily training.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:24.580
Yes, sir.

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:27.290
Ypsilon.

00:07:28.330 --> 00:07:30.540
I was the one who let Chirico escape.

00:07:33.170 --> 00:07:37.040
His Majesty may have figured that out already.

00:07:37.710 --> 00:07:38.880
You knew?

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:40.460
Of course.

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:43.420
I'm prepared for punishment.

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:47.710
That won't be necessary.

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:51.080
Whoever you may love, however it may hurt me,

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:53.750
all that matters will be settled in battle!

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.460
You're sure about that intelligence?

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:09.040
It's a formal declaration by
the Kummen government.

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:11.540
The Melkian government really sent an envoy?

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:14.380
Yes. He arrived in Zaiden last night.

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:17.250
Immediately establishing ties
between the two countries.

00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:18.750
I don't believe it.

00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:22.210
For twenty years we've been at war
with the Melkians.

00:08:22.420 --> 00:08:23.920
And now a cease fire?

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:25.460
It's happened.

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:29.790
And now the Kummen government will
turn all its military power on us.

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:32.250
We're predicting that
a huge offensive is imminent.

00:08:33.380 --> 00:08:34.750
Call a general staff meeting.

00:08:34.750 --> 00:08:36.920
Summon all generals and staff officers.

00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:38.330
Yes, sir.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:49.880
What's up? They're preparing for
a full-scale mobilization.

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:52.250
You need to ask? The big push is starting.

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:55.250
But the government troops aren't rolling yet.

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:56.960
When they do, it'll be too late.

00:08:57.710 --> 00:08:59.210
Now carry this!

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:05.460
Hold down the fort.

00:09:06.130 --> 00:09:08.000
But sir, why are you going to Zaiden?

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:10.210
I'll explain later.

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:11.880
And as for Chirico...

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:15.130
You're not to lay a finger on him.

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:18.420
And Niitan is EX-10's lifeline.

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:20.330
Don't forget that!

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:30.670
Go!

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:38.630
Strangely active today, isn't it?

00:09:38.630 --> 00:09:40.330
Bet he's headed for Zaiden.

00:09:41.170 --> 00:09:43.580
Probably has to do with that Melkian envoy.

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:44.960
Here, open wide.

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:48.580
Are you kidding? The big idiot's
just a mercenary boss.

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:50.420
What's he have to do with the Melkians?

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:51.790
That's a very good question.

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:54.540
He seems to be in good with nearly everyone.

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:56.460
I wouldn't be surprised
if he's got something cooking.

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:58.420
Okay, one more.

00:09:58.420 --> 00:10:01.290
Wait a minute... He's running scared.

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:04.790
Once the treaty's in place,
they may sweep out all the mercenaries.

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:08.460
Pops, you're worried about
losing your job, aren't you?

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:11.130
It's nothing to laugh about!
I'm going to Zaiden, too.

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:11.830
Huh?

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:16.580
I'm afraid of what the Assembly's going to decide.
And I want to check up on Gon Nu.

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:19.670
I should get to Zaiden by nightfall.

00:10:20.170 --> 00:10:22.210
I'll contact you at 9:00, Chirico.

00:10:22.210 --> 00:10:23.670
Right, I got you.

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:26.670
Man, is he in a hurry.

00:10:26.670 --> 00:10:28.040
Here, Chirico. Ahhhh.

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:30.920
He's sick, for crying out loud! Give it a rest!

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:33.750
Shut up. Just leave us alone.

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:40.540
I'll stay here till you're all better.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:48.170
Thought he needed absolute quiet.

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:51.330
Gotho must've gotten the doctor in on this.

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:55.210
I think you should get him now,
while the general's gone.

00:11:46.170 --> 00:11:47.040
Chirico?

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:47.790
Yeah.

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:49.960
I'm in Zaiden, and the shit's hit the fan.

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:51.960
They've signed a military alliance!

00:11:51.960 --> 00:11:53.000
I thought so.

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:55.330
But it won't be affecting my business.

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:57.380
It looks like the government troops
and the merc forces

00:11:57.380 --> 00:11:59.790
are going to begin
hitting the Veela at full strength.

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:00.790
Should be soon.

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:05.710
And Gon Nu's been hanging around
with a Melkian official.

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:06.960
A soldier?!

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:08.670
Looks that way. Real hush-hush, too.

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:10.290
Can you find out who it is?

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:13.330
Tricky, but I'll try. Just don't get your hopes up.

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:20.330
So, you reveal your true colors!

00:12:21.960 --> 00:12:23.290
This isn't anything.

00:12:23.960 --> 00:12:28.580
The general ordered me not to lay a finger on you.

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:30.290
I'm glad to hear that.

00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:32.290
But this doesn't apply!

00:12:32.290 --> 00:12:35.630
You're obviously behaving suspiciously!

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:37.170
Take him!

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:40.420
They signed a military alliance.

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:42.920
Meaning the final battle with
the Veela is coming up.

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:43.710
Understand?

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:46.420
Shut up! Bring him along!

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:04.580
Good night. See you.

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:05.830
Dishes washed?

00:13:05.830 --> 00:13:06.500
All set.

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:09.460
Hold it, we still have these receipts to file.

00:13:09.710 --> 00:13:11.420
Gimme a break, please?

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:15.750
I thought I'd visit Chirico after we closed up.

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:18.540
Listen, that's not just a hospital.

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:20.500
They won't just let you in anytime you want to.

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:21.830
That's okay.

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:25.670
No soldier can resist my obvious charm.

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:29.130
Would you let him rest?!
You know how late it is?!

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:32.670
Yeah, hello. Club Fantom.

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:34.330
Oh, Potaria.

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:36.710
Chirico?

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:38.380
No, he isn't here.

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:39.500
I see...

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:42.380
Yeah, I checked the infirmary
and Gotho's office.

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:43.380
Don't worry.

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:45.790
Yeah. I have another idea of where to check.

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:49.210
I see. Thanks for your help. Good luck.

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:52.080
Admit it! You're working for the Veela!

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:54.580
That enemy pilot was your contact, wasn't he?!

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:58.170
We'll make him answer.

00:13:58.170 --> 00:13:59.670
Just leave this to me.

00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:01.790
Okay, do what you want.

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:06.210
I've been wanting to take a shot at
that smart-ass face of his.

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:08.750
You little...

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:14.500
Like that?

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:17.380
Son of a...!

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:25.380
Who's there?

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:26.750
Pol Potaria.

00:14:26.750 --> 00:14:28.380
You know how late it is?

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:29.630
Chirico's gone.

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:32.630
We've looked everywhere except here.

00:14:33.210 --> 00:14:35.290
I'm conducting a special interrogation. Get lost!

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:40.670
You do know what General Gon Nu
ordered, don't you?

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:41.830
Move your foot!

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:43.750
Give us Chirico, sir!

00:14:44.460 --> 00:14:45.380
You...

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:46.290
Captain!

00:14:46.710 --> 00:14:48.580
Captain! The Veela!

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:50.880
The Veela main forces are
approaching the base!

00:14:51.170 --> 00:14:52.040
What?!

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:54.130
What was that?

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:56.250
The Veela have surrounded Niitan!

00:14:57.920 --> 00:14:59.080
God dammit!

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:01.250
Gimme that!

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:03.250
Niitan's been surrounded?

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:07.210
What?! A major Veela force?!

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:08.630
Get me more details!

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:10.250
And get everyone on base ready for combat!

00:15:11.130 --> 00:15:14.500
Whoa, who was beatin' up who in here?

00:15:15.750 --> 00:15:18.330
There you go.
Now we can have another big fight, Chirico.

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:19.540
Hold it, damn you!

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:21.670
We can't fight without him, sir.

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:29.540
Your orders, sir?

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:39.540
Move out!

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:53.420
Something's happened to Chirico!

00:15:53.420 --> 00:15:54.750
You can't help him.

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:56.540
Besides, business comes first.

00:15:57.080 --> 00:15:59.580
Lemme go! You're ripping off the feathers!

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:04.290
Look, if we keep the profits up like this
in three years we'll be on easy street.

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:06.040
I couldn't care less!

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:10.750
Well, if we get rich,
we can help Chirico out better.

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:17.130
All he thinks about is that other girl.

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:20.880
When he's healthy, he's always going out to fight.

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:23.460
This is the only chance I have to be with him!

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:26.460
Are you crying?

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.040
Leave me alone!

00:16:28.040 --> 00:16:30.630
You don't know how I feel at all!

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:33.500
And you don't understand how I feel, either.

00:16:35.210 --> 00:16:39.250
I didn't go swimming through
any sewers on his account!

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:41.580
Then who were you doing it for?!

00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:43.210
Well, I...

00:16:43.210 --> 00:16:44.080
What?

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:46.750
I sorta... I did it on account of you.

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:55.750
What did you just say?

00:16:56.880 --> 00:16:58.500
Don't take it too seriously, okay?

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:01.380
Come on, say it again.

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:03.250
It's nothing to get worked up about.

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:05.920
Never mind. Say it! Go on!

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:11.420
I think that I...

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:16.250
What was that?!

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:17.880
Wait!

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:24.130
What the hell?!

00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:25.290
The Veela!

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:27.920
Don't be ridiculous.
That came from inside the town!

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:34.790
Here they come.

00:17:34.790 --> 00:17:36.210
We have to get out of here!

00:17:36.210 --> 00:17:37.170
What about the club?

00:17:37.170 --> 00:17:39.000
Night raid!

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:45.290
Damn!

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:45.920
Vanilla!

00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:46.830
What?!

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:48.830
Tell me what you were going to say before!

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:51.210
This isn't the time!

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:52.630
Vanilla!

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:27.710
Move out!

00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:00.130
Take us down!

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:50.080
Strange... There are no ATs.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:53.920
Careful. They're close!

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:02.130
Their main force is north of the base.

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:05.630
Units 24, 25, and 26 head north!

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:12.130
Captain.

00:20:12.130 --> 00:20:13.130
What?!

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:14.670
This is just a decoy operation.

00:20:14.670 --> 00:20:15.630
It's a what?!

00:20:16.170 --> 00:20:19.630
I don't see any ATs anywhere.

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:23.580
They're keeping us busy here
so they can burn Niitan to the ground.

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:26.250
Don't be ridiculous!
You want us to leave the base?!

00:20:26.420 --> 00:20:27.420
Captain!

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:31.420
Niitan's Assemble EX-10's supply lifeline!

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:33.750
It's obvious they're trying to keep us here!

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:36.420
Shut up! I don't want to hear any more of this!

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:38.710
Chirico, stop!

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:43.040
Chirico, where are you going?

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:44.130
To Niitan.

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:45.420
How?

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:48.000
There are transport trailers.

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:54.170
Count me in!

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:56.330
You bastards!

00:20:56.330 --> 00:20:58.210
This is against regulations!

00:20:58.210 --> 00:21:00.000
The regs have exceptions.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:02.330
Like when your commander's
a god damned incompetent!

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:03.540
Wait!

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:06.750
You...!

00:21:06.750 --> 00:21:09.130
I'll have you all shot for insubordination!

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:14.420
Shit...

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:28.960
Hold it!

00:21:29.540 --> 00:21:31.750
Capt. Kan Yu's orders.

00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:33.500
One step closer and we shoot!

00:21:46.540 --> 00:21:47.540
Shako!

00:21:49.670 --> 00:21:50.880
Get on!

00:22:08.210 --> 00:22:10.420
Vanilla, we have to get out of here!

00:22:10.580 --> 00:22:13.500
Go if you want to! I'm going to save this place!

00:22:13.500 --> 00:22:14.920
You want to die?

00:22:14.920 --> 00:22:15.920
Get going!

00:22:16.210 --> 00:22:18.290
I can't just leave you!

00:22:20.920 --> 00:22:22.130
I said go!

00:22:22.130 --> 00:22:23.250
No!

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:41.750
With a roar, everything had begun to happen.

00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:44.080
I couldn't see what was ahead,

00:22:44.080 --> 00:22:46.420
but I saw now that everything was connected.

00:22:46.830 --> 00:22:48.880
And then I knew.

00:22:49.250 --> 00:22:52.630
This was all just a prelude to an approaching hell.

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:55.710
Next Episode

00:22:56.170 --> 00:22:57.960
Cease-fires for the sake of restarting a war.

00:22:57.960 --> 00:22:59.790
Destruction for the sake of building.

00:23:00.130 --> 00:23:03.500
The old madness continues till the end of history.

00:23:03.960 --> 00:23:06.500
Some will suffer for it. Some will be hurt by it.

00:23:06.500 --> 00:23:09.000
Still others given over to despair.

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:14.040
But as a life he built goes up in smoke,
a man begins to grumble in discontent.

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:17.500
And suddenly the smell of gunpowder
doesn't seem so bad.

00:23:18.250 --> 00:23:20.420
Next time, "Intentions"

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:24.290
Intentions

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:24.290
Next Time

00:23:20.420 --> 00:23:22.750
God doesn't mark anything with a period.

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:46.000
Samishii toki mo

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:49.540
Kanashii toki mo

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:55.920
Itsumo anata ga me ni ukabu

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:59.960
Hitori no toki mo

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:03.380
Aitai toki mo

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:09.630
Itsumo anata wa mune no naka

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:13.130
Tooku hanarete itemo

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:16.540
Tatoe wakarete itemo

00:24:16.710 --> 00:24:23.040
Kono yo no hikari to tomo ni mabushiku

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:29.380
Ano hi no anata ga...
